### Sentinel API -- manual request collection (VS Code REST Client extension format)
### Component: api/tests
### Status: complete. Run the API (npm run dev) and MongoDB locally first.
### Every endpoint has at least one success case and one deliberate-failure case.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/v1

### --- Health -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Success: service is up.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### --- Events -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Success: list all events.
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Success: list events filtered by sourceIp.
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sourceIp=203.0.113.50

### Success: create a single event.
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-http-001",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "eventType": "AUTH_FAILURE",
  "sourceIp": "203.0.113.201",
  "account": "jdoe",
  "host": "workstation-01",
  "details": { "method": "ssh" }
}

### Success: create a batch of events.
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "eventId": "evt-http-002",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-01T10:00:05.000Z",
      "eventType": "AUTH_SUCCESS",
      "sourceIp": "203.0.113.201",
      "account": "jdoe",
      "host": "workstation-01",
      "details": { "method": "ssh" }
    }
  ]
}

### FAILURE: invalid body -- missing required "host" field. Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-http-003",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "eventType": "AUTH_FAILURE",
  "sourceIp": "203.0.113.201"
}

### FAILURE: duplicate eventId (run the "create a single event" request above twice).
### Expect 409 CONFLICT on the second attempt.
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-http-001",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "eventType": "AUTH_FAILURE",
  "sourceIp": "203.0.113.201",
  "account": "jdoe",
  "host": "workstation-01",
  "details": { "method": "ssh" }
}

### --- Incidents ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Success: list all incidents.
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents

### Success: list incidents filtered by status.
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?status=Open

### FAILURE: invalid status filter value. Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?status=NotARealStatus

### Success: fetch a single incident (replace with a real id from the list above).
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/000000000000000000000000

### FAILURE: unknown incident id. Expect 404 NOT_FOUND.
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/000000000000000000000000

### Success: trigger analysis of currently-stored events.
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents/analyze

### FAILURE (environment-dependent): analyzer binary not built/available yet.
### Expect 500 ANALYZER_ERROR until analyzer/build/debug/sentinel-analyzer exists.
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents/analyze

### Success: update incident status (replace :id with a real id).
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/000000000000000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Investigating"
}

### FAILURE: invalid status value. Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incidents/000000000000000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Archived"
}

### Success: delete an incident (replace :id with a real id).
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/incidents/000000000000000000000000

### FAILURE: delete an unknown incident id. Expect 404 NOT_FOUND.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/incidents/000000000000000000000000
